      "value": "@{5da4ecc441f64735c05ee008|full_name}: From Tupper:\n> Dynamic Bones runs on your processor, and can eat quite a bit of CPU time. **It is also probably the most expensive single component you can put on your avatar.** VRChat strongly recommends that you do not have any more than 30 affected transforms on any one avatar.\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/avatar-optimizing-tips",
